Constantly pretends that everything is fine.

264
00:22:57.376 --> 00:22:59.878
I think he suffers in his soul.

265
00:23:00.462 --> 00:23:02.381
But isn't it better?

266
00:23:02.464 --> 00:23:05.550
share grief with others
rather than suffer alone?

267
00:23:07.636 --> 00:23:11.139
I don't know. He needs more time for himself.

268
00:23:15.852 --> 00:23:16.853
You were like that too...

269
00:23:19.314 --> 00:23:20.899
when did your father die

270
00:23:23.693 --> 00:23:27.781
Knowing you, I bet
you suffered alone.

271
00:23:29.616 --> 00:23:31.868
I had no one to share it with.

272
00:23:36.331 --> 00:23:38.250
Maybe he feels that way too.

273
00:23:41.169 --> 00:23:42.754
- Mubi.
- What?

274
00:23:45.966 --> 00:23:46.842
I'm sorry

275
00:23:47.467 --> 00:23:50.053
You always protected me as a child,

276
00:23:50.554 --> 00:23:52.889
and I wasn't there when you were having a hard time.

277
00:23:54.766 --> 00:23:56.184
No use to me.

278
00:23:57.269 --> 00:23:58.687
Everything is fine.

279
00:23:59.438 --> 00:24:03.275
I'm more worried about you.
Are you sure you're all right?

280
00:24:03.942 --> 00:24:05.610
You're not sick, are you?

281
00:24:06.695 --> 00:24:08.447
I'm not lying about being sick.

282
00:24:10.282 --> 00:24:12.451
It is very lonely when you suffer alone.

283
00:24:19.583 --> 00:24:20.417
aren't you going

284
00:24:20.500 --> 00:24:23.462
I wanted to leave when Golem returned.

285
00:24:24.045 --> 00:24:26.756
Why is he still not at home at this hour?

286
00:24:26.840 --> 00:24:28.967
- It probably works.
- Are you kidding?

287
00:24:29.676 --> 00:24:31.761
Doesn't a freelancer work at home?

288
00:24:31.845 --> 00:24:35.348
And it's dangerous now.
He should be back by now.

289
00:24:35.932 --> 00:24:36.892
I'm worried.

290
00:24:37.434 --> 00:24:40.937
You seem to care more about Guillaume,
than about me

291
00:24:41.021 --> 00:24:43.190
and it gets on my nerves.

292
00:24:46.067 --> 00:24:49.070
Aren't you worried about him?
Did you call him?

293
00:24:49.613 --> 00:24:51.907
Goem is an adult.

294
00:24:51.990 --> 00:24:54.034
go Right now.

295
00:24:54.117 --> 00:24:56.578
- Go.
- Okay, I'll go.

296
00:24:57.162 --> 00:24:58.997
- I'm going.
- Come on.

297
00:24:59.080 --> 00:25:00.165
bye

298
00:25:03.001 --> 00:25:04.586
- See you soon.
- Yes.

299
00:25:45.627 --> 00:25:47.045
We are closed.

300
00:25:47.837 --> 00:25:49.589
Closed?

301
00:25:54.302 --> 00:25:55.136
Yes.

302
00:25:56.721 --> 00:25:57.806
can i sit down

303
00:25:59.683 --> 00:26:03.353
I'm not here to
to quarrel I just…

304
00:26:05.730 --> 00:26:07.566
I'm too sad to be alone.

305
00:26:51.026 --> 00:26:52.193
are you busy

306
00:26:53.194 --> 00:26:56.031
I offered to meet Gyom,
but you didn't answer

307
00:26:57.365 --> 00:26:59.200
did you talk to him

308
00:26:59.701 --> 00:27:02.162
I'm sure he will open up to you more.

309
00:27:02.746 --> 00:27:05.999
So how is he? Is it difficult for him?

310
00:27:06.082 --> 00:27:07.751
I don't know what to say.

311
00:27:08.251 --> 00:27:09.669
You haven't talked to him yet?

312
00:27:13.840 --> 00:27:16.676
Don't say you haven't seen him since.

313
00:27:19.095 --> 00:27:20.513
Si Chun!

314
00:27:20.597 --> 00:27:22.849
I don't know what to say to him.

315
00:27:27.979 --> 00:27:28.813
What?

316
00:27:28.897 --> 00:27:31.024
And you haven't changed.

317
00:27:31.107 --> 00:27:33.860
You still don't know how to express your feelings.

318
00:27:33.943 --> 00:27:35.779
How could I forget?

319
00:27:38.073 --> 00:27:39.324
Do you want to fight?

320
00:27:39.407 --> 00:27:44.329
If you don't know what to say
don't say anything Just be there.

321
00:27:44.412 --> 00:27:47.165
Gjom has known you for a long time. He knows what you are like.

322
00:27:47.666 --> 00:27:49.668
Don't avoid it.

323
00:27:50.210 --> 00:27:52.879
At least make an effort.

324
00:27:54.756 --> 00:27:58.009
Call him or visit him and support him.

325
00:28:02.764 --> 00:28:03.848
what are you doing

326
00:28:05.100 --> 00:28:06.518
I knew Stomach disorder.

327
00:28:07.310 --> 00:28:10.647
You always have an upset stomach
when you avoid talking

328
00:28:10.730 --> 00:28:12.899
I saw you push.

329
00:28:12.982 --> 00:28:16.236
You pretend to be calm
but your body betrays you.

330
00:28:16.319 --> 00:28:17.237
This is not true.

331
00:28:17.320 --> 00:28:19.322
what's wrong with you

332
00:28:20.323 --> 00:28:23.493
Is it so hard to say words of support?

333
00:28:26.663 --> 00:28:27.831
This is because…

334
00:28:30.250 --> 00:28:32.335
I can't speak well.

335
00:28:34.379 --> 00:28:35.714
Therefore, it is better to remain silent.

336
00:28:36.881 --> 00:28:38.717
The words do not sound sincere...

337
00:28:40.385 --> 00:28:41.553
from people like me.

338
00:28:58.319 --> 00:28:59.821
Have you seen your relatives?

339
00:29:02.991 --> 00:29:04.159
You are not like that.

340
00:29:05.535 --> 00:29:08.538
Yes, sometimes you are very rude

341
00:29:08.621 --> 00:29:10.790
but I know you are sincere.

342
00:29:14.502 --> 00:29:15.670
Indifferently.

343
00:29:32.520 --> 00:29:34.939
Is it reserved for customers?

344
00:29:35.023 --> 00:29:36.107
You can drink.

345
00:29:36.900 --> 00:29:40.320
Why? And if they come back?
They are obviously a couple.

346
00:29:40.403 --> 00:29:42.655
See the bottles with the names of the couples?

347
00:29:43.615 --> 00:29:45.533
No one has returned yet.

348
00:29:45.617 --> 00:29:48.369
Where does such confidence come from?
Maybe they are busy.

349
00:29:49.370 --> 00:29:50.288
For years?

350
00:29:50.371 --> 00:29:51.790
So long?

351
00:29:51.873 --> 00:29:54.209
They wrote their names in a silly way.

352
00:29:54.292 --> 00:29:56.878
And now they parted
and no one will return.

353
00:29:59.422 --> 00:30:01.174
Did they think they would be together forever?

354
00:30:02.091 --> 00:30:04.010
No one expects a breakup.

355
00:30:05.053 --> 00:30:08.056
And who said all these couples broke up?
And if they come back?

356
00:30:08.139 --> 00:30:09.224
They will not return.

357
00:30:10.642 --> 00:30:11.559
Shall we bet?

358
00:30:12.644 --> 00:30:15.230
Haven't you grown up yet? For 100,000 won?

359
00:30:15.814 --> 00:30:18.441
Agreed. I will ask San Sik.

360
00:30:21.986 --> 00:30:23.822
You never know how it will turn out.

361
00:30:32.997 --> 00:30:35.166
Do not drink from the bottle of Hooni and Sonia.

362
00:30:35.250 --> 00:30:36.334
My God.

363
00:30:56.771 --> 00:30:58.189
Do you want to talk about Chun?

364
00:31:01.317 --> 00:31:04.529
I want to, but I can't with Gyom.

365
00:31:08.366 --> 00:31:09.367
Of course.

366
00:31:15.248 --> 00:31:17.292
I remember when we met.

367
00:31:18.668 --> 00:31:22.005
I was shocked to see
such a handsome man in front of the school.

368
00:31:24.382 --> 00:31:27.635
And it was even more shocking that
that he is Ko Geum's brother.

369
00:31:27.719 --> 00:31:30.722
your truth They are not similar at all.

370
00:31:31.222 --> 00:31:34.475
I asked Chun more than once,
are they really brothers

371
00:31:34.976 --> 00:31:36.978
- Did you ask?
- Yes.

372
00:31:50.825 --> 00:31:53.661
<i>I'm at home. What do you do, Kim Mubi?</i>

373
00:31:53.745 --> 00:31:55.663
<i>Are you sleeping yet, Kim Mubi?</i>

374
00:31:56.247 --> 00:31:58.625
<i>Directors usually go to bed late.</i>

375
00:32:08.384 --> 00:32:09.469
Probably sleeping.

376
00:33:33.136 --> 00:33:34.303
what are you doing here

377
00:33:38.933 --> 00:33:41.519
I was looking for something.

378
00:33:55.992 --> 00:33:56.826
Gomme.

379
00:33:57.410 --> 00:33:58.286
What?

380
00:33:58.369 --> 00:34:00.621
Did you spend the night in the car?

381
00:34:06.210 --> 00:34:08.212
I came home late.

382
00:34:10.631 --> 00:34:15.053
I also saw yesterday morning
how did you get out of the car

383
00:34:15.803 --> 00:34:16.971
If you think

384
00:34:17.055 --> 00:34:19.974
I haven't seen in a long time
that you turn on the lights at home.

385
00:34:24.896 --> 00:34:27.190
Do you sleep in the car every day?

386
00:34:33.654 --> 00:34:34.489
Why?

387
00:34:42.288 --> 00:34:43.372
Gomme.

388
00:34:48.336 --> 00:34:49.253
At home...

389
00:34:51.172 --> 00:34:52.173
there is no one

390
00:34:57.929 --> 00:35:00.264
There's no one there, Mubi.

391
00:35:02.266 --> 00:35:05.103
<i>No matter how you pretend that life goes on...</i>

392
00:35:07.021 --> 00:35:08.523
That's why I can't go there.

393
00:35:10.191 --> 00:35:14.362
<i>…debris inside you</i>
<i>signals are always given.</i>

394
00:35:17.573 --> 00:35:18.741
Why didn't you say…

395
00:35:18.825 --> 00:35:20.910
But now everything is fine.

396
00:35:21.619 --> 00:35:23.454
I was going to stop by today.

397
00:35:24.122 --> 00:35:26.874
It's an old car, it's uncomfortable.

398
00:35:27.375 --> 00:35:30.711
And the house is a mess, so you have to clean it up.

399
00:35:32.839 --> 00:35:33.673
Really?

400
00:35:34.924 --> 00:35:37.927
Yes, don't worry.

401
00:35:40.721 --> 00:35:43.808
<i>And anxiety creeps in again.</i>

402
00:35:45.393 --> 00:35:46.644
ok

403
00:35:48.521 --> 00:35:51.107
I have to get ready for work. I will go

404
00:35:51.732 --> 00:35:52.567
Good.

405
00:36:19.510 --> 00:36:21.512
Here are the meeting materials, director.

406
00:36:39.947 --> 00:36:42.783
She has long straight hair, but after a year

407
00:36:42.867 --> 00:36:45.453
her hair should be changed

408
00:36:45.536 --> 00:36:46.829
to make it stand out...

409
00:36:50.041 --> 00:36:51.542
As for clothes…

410
00:37:45.638 --> 00:37:48.224
I went in, but…

411
00:37:53.854 --> 00:37:54.689
Mubi.

412
00:37:57.275 --> 00:37:58.109
What?

413
00:38:00.152 --> 00:38:01.737
Something seems wrong with me.

414
00:38:05.533 --> 00:38:06.617
Everything is fine.

415
00:38:38.983 --> 00:38:39.942
I am sending a message.

416
00:38:42.320 --> 00:38:43.779
did you get

417
00:39:02.715 --> 00:39:03.549
Gomme.

418
00:39:04.633 --> 00:39:05.468
What?

419
00:39:07.636 --> 00:39:11.891
When tomorrow comes, we will go home together.

420
00:39:13.517 --> 00:39:14.352
Good.

421
00:39:50.471 --> 00:39:51.305
I'm sorry

422
00:39:53.474 --> 00:39:55.893
Wait! what are you doing

423
00:39:55.976 --> 00:39:57.019
Open the door.

424
00:40:04.026 --> 00:40:05.277
Is this an access code?

425
00:40:06.612 --> 00:40:07.446
OK.

426
00:40:08.322 --> 00:40:09.156
But...

427
00:40:09.907 --> 00:40:11.992
Why do you need a pillow and all these things?

428
00:40:12.576 --> 00:40:14.578
What is it? Are you moving here?

429
00:40:14.662 --> 00:40:15.996
- Yes.
- What?

430
00:40:16.497 --> 00:40:17.665
For a while.

431
00:40:18.666 --> 00:40:20.000
Are you crazy?

432
00:40:20.626 --> 00:40:22.461
Your home is over there.

433
00:40:23.212 --> 00:40:24.880
What will you tell your mother?

434
00:40:24.964 --> 00:40:27.716
She is not so old-fashioned. She doesn't mind.

435
00:40:28.926 --> 00:40:29.927
Did you tell her?

436
00:40:30.010 --> 00:40:32.513
She said that she will stay in the office because she is busy.

437
00:40:33.431 --> 00:40:37.852
"Office" can mean many things.

438
00:40:39.895 --> 00:40:41.397
did you lie

439
00:40:42.106 --> 00:40:43.274
Unless?

440
00:40:43.357 --> 00:40:46.277
But in the mother-daughter relationship
no way without lies.

441
00:40:46.360 --> 00:40:49.405
Stay for now. Get ready.

442
00:40:55.035 --> 00:40:57.538
By the way, this is pretty good:

443
00:40:57.621 --> 00:41:00.124
I leave you at home and go to work.

444
00:41:01.208 --> 00:41:02.126
That is?

445
00:41:02.209 --> 00:41:04.545
Can I hope for a home run?

446
00:41:05.379 --> 00:41:06.213
Why?

447
00:41:06.297 --> 00:41:09.383
Consider this a preview
married life with someone. bye

448
00:41:10.384 --> 00:41:11.302
What?

449
00:41:12.303 --> 00:41:13.554
What are you saying?

450
00:41:14.054 --> 00:41:15.890
Married life with whom?

451
00:41:33.240 --> 00:41:34.950
<i>I will be home after work.</i>

452
00:41:35.034 --> 00:41:36.660
<i>Try to be at home too.</i>

453
00:41:40.331 --> 00:41:43.334
Director, you need to visit the site.

454
00:41:45.127 --> 00:41:46.212
Today?

455
00:41:55.679 --> 00:41:56.972
{\an8}VIDEO BAR

456
00:41:57.056 --> 00:41:59.975
That is, you left the bottle here
five years ago?

457
00:42:00.059 --> 00:42:00.893
Yes.

458
00:42:00.976 --> 00:42:03.979
I think we wrote "Sang Gyu loves Jung Yoon".

459
00:42:04.063 --> 00:42:06.315
"Sang Gyu loves Jung..."

460
00:42:06.398 --> 00:42:07.233
Jung Yoon.

461
00:42:07.316 --> 00:42:09.318
Yes. Ms. Jung Yoon.

462
00:42:10.778 --> 00:42:12.863
- I'm looking.
- If not, it's not scary.

463
00:42:14.240 --> 00:42:17.117
I know you. I remember you!

464
00:42:17.201 --> 00:42:18.953
Lord How much time has passed.

465
00:42:19.036 --> 00:42:20.829
- A lot.
- Yes!

466
00:42:21.413 --> 00:42:23.207
Sang Gyu and Jung Yoon, right?

467
00:42:23.290 --> 00:42:24.708
My God!

468
00:42:25.209 --> 00:42:27.294
Did you keep it?

469
00:42:27.378 --> 00:42:29.296
I am very touched.

470
00:42:29.380 --> 00:42:30.714
- Let's take a photo.
- Yes.

471
00:42:30.798 --> 00:42:33.801
She's been here too long. I do not recommend drinking.

472
00:42:33.884 --> 00:42:36.095
- Better throw it away.
- That is?

473
00:42:36.178 --> 00:42:38.347
They came here to drink from it.

474
00:42:39.014 --> 00:42:42.601
So why didn't you come for five years?

475
00:42:44.478 --> 00:42:47.314
We parted ways.

476
00:42:47.815 --> 00:42:49.817
And then they met again.

477
00:42:49.900 --> 00:42:52.486
And we are getting married.

478
00:42:55.197 --> 00:42:56.448
Wow, really?

479
00:42:56.532 --> 00:42:58.450
Congratulations. In that case

480
00:42:58.951 --> 00:43:00.786
it's worth treating you to a drink.

481
00:43:00.869 --> 00:43:03.122
This is a beautiful drink.

482
00:43:06.041 --> 00:43:07.209
a minute

483
00:43:07.710 --> 00:43:09.378
Have we got a thief?

484
00:43:09.461 --> 00:43:11.255
I swear there were so many.

485
00:43:12.965 --> 00:43:14.216
Is this your bottle?

486
00:43:14.300 --> 00:43:15.134
My.

487
00:43:15.217 --> 00:43:17.094
Who are Huni and Soni?

488
00:43:17.177 --> 00:43:19.138
These are my favorite dogs.

489
00:43:20.389 --> 00:43:23.058
And now let's drink.

490
00:43:23.684 --> 00:43:25.644
Although someone has already been drinking.

491
00:43:26.312 --> 00:43:27.980
A drink for everyone.

492
00:43:28.063 --> 00:43:31.066
- When is your wedding?
- Next spring.

493
00:43:50.377 --> 00:43:52.212
<i>You got home normally...</i>

494
00:44:03.682 --> 00:44:05.184
<i>As for the whiskey...</i>

495
00:44:11.732 --> 00:44:12.566
<i>Are you sleeping?</i>

496
00:44:35.839 --> 00:44:37.424
<i>I wrote a new song.</i>

497
00:44:45.849 --> 00:44:47.309
SONG CHU A

498
00:45:23.137 --> 00:45:25.222
Gomm! Go Goem!

499
00:45:31.895 --> 00:45:32.896
Gomme.

500
00:45:34.106 --> 00:45:37.192
Go Goem!

501
00:45:38.819 --> 00:45:39.653
Gomm!

502
00:45:44.241 --> 00:45:45.325
My God!

503
00:45:47.244 --> 00:45:49.329
You scared me.

504
00:45:49.413 --> 00:45:51.081
You scared me even more.

505
00:45:51.165 --> 00:45:52.583
Did you just come back?

506
00:45:54.001 --> 00:45:57.254
What do you do when the lights are off?

507
00:45:59.214 --> 00:46:03.218
Electricity and gas were turned off.
I guess I didn't pay.

508
00:46:03.802 --> 00:46:04.678
What?

509
00:46:18.066 --> 00:46:20.152
Should have lit more candles?

510
00:46:23.864 --> 00:46:24.698
are you crying

511
00:46:25.783 --> 00:46:27.034
Are you so scared?

512
00:46:36.627 --> 00:46:39.963
<i>And to ward off sudden anxiety,</i>
<i>that creeps in again…</i>

513
00:46:56.772 --> 00:46:57.940
Gomme.

514
00:47:03.278 --> 00:47:04.488
You are not alone.

515
00:47:06.323 --> 00:47:09.660
<i>…will be enough</i>
<i>just a moment or a few</i>

516
00:47:09.743 --> 00:47:10.661
<i>simple words.</i>

517
00:47:28.595 --> 00:47:30.180
i love you

518
00:47:45.863 --> 00:47:46.864
So from now on…

519
00:47:48.615 --> 00:47:49.950
we will never…

520
00:47:52.870 --> 00:47:54.121
themselves

521
00:49:35.514 --> 00:49:37.724
Honsi, why are you taking so long?

522
00:49:41.895 --> 00:49:43.730
Should I have gone to the bar?

523
00:49:47.192 --> 00:49:48.360
What is it?

524
00:49:49.569 --> 00:49:51.613
- Why are you here?
- You said that you wrote a song.

525
00:49:51.697 --> 00:49:52.990
I want to hear first.

526
00:49:55.075 --> 00:49:56.284
<i>I turn on.</i>

527
00:50:05.961 --> 00:50:06.795
What do you say?

528
00:50:10.507 --> 00:50:11.425
What?

529
00:50:11.925 --> 00:50:13.927
What? Is it so bad?

530
00:50:15.262 --> 00:50:17.014
I was sure that this one was successful.

531
00:50:18.890 --> 00:50:20.934
Who else did you listen to?

532
00:50:21.018 --> 00:50:22.310
Only you.

533
00:50:22.394 --> 00:50:24.479
Can I be the first to listen to your songs?

534
00:50:24.563 --> 00:50:25.605
Why?

535
00:50:25.689 --> 00:50:27.524
I listen to a lot of music

